Barehand Specialization is the advanced mastery of unarmed combat available
only to monks. Building upon the foundation of barehand proficiency, this
skill allows the monk to execute additional strikes per round with their
bare hands.

Where proficiency teaches the basics of fighting without weapons,
specialization transforms the monk's body into a blur of motion. Masters
can strike with such speed and precision that opponents find themselves
overwhelmed before they can mount an effective defense.

This skill combines with other monk disciplines such as Kubo, Iron Fist,
and Voplat to create a devastating unarmed fighting style that rivals
or exceeds the effectiveness of armed combat.

Class: Monk
Discipline: Barehand

See Also: BAREHAND PROFICIENCY, KUBO, IRON FIST
